msgid "GPU layers"
msgstr "GPU-Layer"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Layers offloaded to the GPU. 0 = pure CPU, 999 = all."
msgstr "Auf die GPU ausgelagerte Layer. 0 = reine CPU, 999 = alle."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "CPU threads"
msgstr "CPU-Threads"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "0 = half your physical cores, so the machine stays responsive while an answer is generated. More = faster answers but can slow the rest of the system; raise it gradually."
msgstr "0 = die Hälfte deiner physischen Kerne, damit der Rechner während der Antwort reaktionsfähig bleibt. Mehr = schnellere Antworten, kann aber den Rest des Systems verlangsamen; schrittweise erhöhen."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Prompt batch size"
msgstr "Prompt-Batch-Größe"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Logical batch (n_batch). Keep ≥ the micro-batch."
msgstr "Logischer Batch (n_batch). ≥ dem Micro-Batch halten."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Default (2048)"
msgstr "Standard (2048)"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Prompt micro-batch size"
msgstr "Prompt-Micro-Batch-Größe"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Physical micro-batch (n_ubatch): the GPU prefill-speed lever. Must stay ≤ the batch size — larger values are greyed out."
msgstr "Physischer Micro-Batch (n_ubatch): der Hebel für die GPU-Prefill-Geschwindigkeit. Muss ≤ der Batch-Größe bleiben — größere Werte sind ausgegraut."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Default (512)"
msgstr "Standard (512)"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "f16 — full (default)"
msgstr "f16 — voll (Standard)"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "q8_0 — half"
msgstr "q8_0 — halb"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "q4_0 — quarter"
msgstr "q4_0 — viertel"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "K cache"
msgstr "K-Cache"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Key-cache precision. Quantizing K saves memory without needing flash attention."
msgstr "Präzision des Key-Cache. K zu quantisieren spart Speicher, ohne Flash Attention zu brauchen."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "V cache"
msgstr "V-Cache"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Flash attention"
msgstr "Flash Attention"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Faster attention, less memory; required for quantizing the V cache. Needed when the V cache is q8_0/q4_0."
msgstr "Schnellere Attention, weniger Speicher; nötig zum Quantisieren des V-Cache. Erforderlich, wenn der V-Cache q8_0/q4_0 ist."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Memory-map model"
msgstr "Modell per Memory-Map"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "On (default) maps the model file lazily. Off loads it fully into RAM — a longer 'Loading model…' but no page-faults during the answer; needs enough free RAM."
msgstr "An (Standard) mappt die Modelldatei bei Bedarf. Aus lädt sie vollständig in den RAM — ein längeres „Modell wird geladen…“, aber keine Page-Faults während der Antwort; braucht genug freien RAM."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Max answer length"
msgstr "Max. Antwortlänge"

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Hard cap on generated tokens. Bounds the answer and stops a model that gets stuck repeating itself (~1.5 words/token)."
msgstr "Harte Obergrenze für erzeugte Tokens. Begrenzt die Antwort und stoppt ein Modell, das sich in Wiederholungen verfängt (~1,5 Wörter/Token)."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid "Value-cache precision. Quantizing V (below f16) needs flash attention."
msgstr "Präzision des Value-Cache. V zu quantisieren (unter f16) braucht Flash Attention."

#: src/markdown_vault/ui/preferences/runtime_subpage.py
msgid " ⚠ Turn on Flash attention below."
msgstr " ⚠ Flash Attention unten einschalten."

